# Extract the content of a page, against the practice server.
Output docs/user/assets/scrape.gif
Source docs/captures/_settings.tape
Hide
Type "export SEEK_SERVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8788 SEEK_SERVER_TOKEN=practice-token && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "seek scrape exa https://example.com/honey"
Enter
Sleep 4s
